  "approvedPolicyText": "Exactly 60 explicitly allowlisted drugs are Free. Every unlisted or newly added drug is Premium by default. No antimicrobial drug may be included in the Free allowlist. Antimicrobial scope includes antibacterial, antiviral, antifungal, antimycobacterial, antiparasitic, antihelminthic, antiprotozoal and antimalarial agents. Frontend lock/paywall metadata is UX only; the gateway remains the final authorization authority.",
